  "selection_policy": "The next independent canonical closures after batch eight that contain neither SELinux nor systemd code. The bracket applet advances through an explicit validated archive/symbol alias. B2sum is isolated from cksum because both compile cksum.c under different algorithm configurations; df is isolated from stat because both compile find-mount-point.c. Previously deferred intrinsic and long-double ABI applets remain in their typed-bridge queues."
